---
---

<div class="ibf-wrap">
  <div class="ibf-success" id="inspection-success" aria-live="polite" hidden>
    <span aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
    <h2>Enquiry received.</h2>
    <p id="inspection-success-message">
      We have received your enquiry and will contact you on WhatsApp to discuss your bathroom project.
      You can share photos and inspiration using the link below. No payment or site visit has been booked.
    </p>
    <a id="inspection-whatsapp-backup" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Continue to WhatsApp
    </a>
  </div>

  <form id="inspection-request-form">
    <div class="ibf-heading">
      <p class="lx-eyebrow">Free initial conversation</p>
      <h2>Let's discuss your bathroom project.</h2>
      <p>Tell us a little about what you are planning. No drawings, measurements or payment are needed to make an enquiry.</p>
    </div>

    <input class="ibf-honeypot" type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" />

    <div class="ibf-grid">
      <label>
        <span>Full name <b aria-hidden="true">*</b></span>
        <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your name" autocomplete="name" required />
      </label>
      <label>
        <span>WhatsApp / phone number <b aria-hidden="true">*</b></span>
        <input type="tel" name="phone" placeholder="e.g. 077 450 3744" autocomplete="tel" required />
      </label>
    </div>

    <label>
      <span>Where is your property located? <b aria-hidden="true">*</b></span>
      <input type="text" name="location" placeholder="City or nearest town" autocomplete="address-level2" required />
    </label>

    <fieldset>
      <legend>Does your project involve one or several bathrooms? <b aria-hidden="true">*</b></legend>
      <div class="ibf-choice-grid ibf-choice-grid--two">
        <label><input type="radio" name="bathroom_scope" value="One bathroom" required /><span>One bathroom</span></label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="bathroom_scope" value="Several bathrooms" /><span>Several bathrooms</span></label>
      </div>
      <p class="ibf-context-note" id="inspection-multiple-note" hidden>You can discuss all your bathrooms in one enquiry. We will review each bathroom separately during consultation.</p>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset>
      <legend>Your bathroom investment</legend>
      <p class="ibf-field-note">Most complete BathSpace bathroom renovations fall within <strong>LKR 1.5M–2.5M per bathroom</strong>, depending on the size, construction requirements, materials and selected fixtures.</p>
      <p class="ibf-field-note">Depending on the project, a complete renovation can include design, plumbing, waterproofing, tiling, bathware, vanity, lighting and finishing. Larger bathrooms, bathtubs or additional custom work may require a higher investment.</p>
      <p class="ibf-budget-question">Does this investment range align with your expectations? <b aria-hidden="true">*</b></p>
      <div class="ibf-choice-grid ibf-choice-grid--two" role="group" aria-label="Budget expectations">
        <label><input type="radio" name="budget_direction" value="Within typical range" required /><span>Yes, this range works for me</span></label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="budget_direction" value="Below typical range" /><span>I was considering a lower investment</span></label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="budget_direction" value="Need budget guidance" /><span>I'm not sure yet — I'd like guidance</span></label>
      </div>
      <p class="ibf-context-note" id="inspection-budget-below-note" hidden>We can discuss your requirements and whether an adjusted scope is suitable. A complete renovation may need a higher investment.</p>
      <p class="ibf-context-note" id="inspection-budget-unsure-note" hidden>That's fine. We can explain what affects bathroom renovation costs during your free conversation.</p>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset>
      <legend>When are you considering starting? <b aria-hidden="true">*</b></legend>
      <div class="ibf-choice-grid ibf-choice-grid--two">
        <label><input type="radio" name="project_timing" value="As soon as possible" required /><span>As soon as possible</span></label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="project_timing" value="Within 1–3 months" /><span>Within 1–3 months</span></label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="project_timing" value="Just researching" /><span>Just exploring options</span></label>
      </div>
    </fieldset>

    <p class="ibf-context-note" id="inspection-research-note" hidden>Still exploring? We can discuss suitable design options, approximate investment ranges and the next steps before you make any commitment.</p>
    <p class="ibf-context-note" id="inspection-ready-note" hidden>Planning to start soon? You can tell us about any existing issues here and share photos on WhatsApp after submitting.</p>

    <label>
      <span>What would you like to improve or achieve? <small>(optional)</small></span>
      <textarea name="notes" rows="3" placeholder="e.g. modern design, better storage, leaks, layout changes or other details"></textarea>
      <small class="ibf-help">For several bathrooms, briefly mention each one. You can share bathroom photos and inspiration through WhatsApp after submitting.</small>
    </label>

    <label class="ibf-consent"><input type="checkbox" name="process_acknowledgement" required /><span>Please contact me about this enquiry by phone or WhatsApp. I understand the initial conversation is free and no paid package is booked.</span></label>
    <a href="https://wa.me/94774503744" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Prefer WhatsApp? Discuss your bathroom →</a>
    <p id="inspection-error" class="ibf-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
    <button class="ibf-submit" id="inspection-submit" type="submit">
      <span>Request my free consultation</span>
      <span hidden>Preparing your request…</span>
    </button>
    <p class="ibf-privacy">By submitting, you agree that BathSpace by LUXEhome may contact you about this enquiry. See our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
  </form>
</div>

<script>
  import { createClient } from '@supabase/supabase-js';
  import { LUXE_SUPABASE_KEY, LUXE_SUPABASE_URL } from '../../lib/luxe-supabase';

  const supabase = createClient(LUXE_SUPABASE_URL, LUXE_SUPABASE_KEY);

  const form = document.getElementById('inspection-request-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
  const success = document.getElementById('inspection-success') as HTMLElement | null;
  const submit = document.getElementById('inspection-submit') as HTMLButtonElement | null;
  const multipleNote = document.getElementById('inspection-multiple-note') as HTMLElement | null;
  const researchNote = document.getElementById('inspection-research-note') as HTMLElement | null;
  const readyNote = document.getElementById('inspection-ready-note') as HTMLElement | null;
  const budgetBelowNote = document.getElementById('inspection-budget-below-note') as HTMLElement | null;
  const budgetUnsureNote = document.getElementById('inspection-budget-unsure-note') as HTMLElement | null;
  const successMessage = document.getElementById('inspection-success-message') as HTMLParagraphElement | null;
  const backupLink = document.getElementById('inspection-whatsapp-backup') as HTMLAnchorElement | null;
  const errorNotice = document.getElementById('inspection-error') as HTMLElement | null;

  function formValue(data: FormData, key: string) {
    return data.get(key)?.toString().trim() ?? '';
  }

  function updateContextNotes() {
    if (!form) return;
    const scope = form.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('input[name="bathroom_scope"]:checked')?.value;
    const timing = form.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('input[name="project_timing"]:checked')?.value;
    const budget = form.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('input[name="budget_direction"]:checked')?.value;
    if (multipleNote) multipleNote.hidden = scope !== 'Several bathrooms';
    if (researchNote) researchNote.hidden = timing !== 'Just researching';
    if (readyNote) readyNote.hidden = timing !== 'As soon as possible';
    if (budgetBelowNote) budgetBelowNote.hidden = budget !== 'Below typical range';
    if (budgetUnsureNote) budgetUnsureNote.hidden = budget !== 'Need budget guidance';
  }

  if (form) {
    const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
    const sourceProject = params.get('source_project') || '';

    form.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('input[name="bathroom_scope"], input[name="project_timing"], input[name="budget_direction"]').forEach((radio) => {
      radio.addEventListener('change', updateContextNotes);
    });
    updateContextNotes();

    form.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      const data = new FormData(form);
      if (formValue(data, 'website')) return;
      if (!form.reportValidity() || !submit || !success) return;

      const name = formValue(data, 'name');
      const phone = formValue(data, 'phone');
      const location = formValue(data, 'location');
      const bathroomScope = formValue(data, 'bathroom_scope');
      const budgetDirection = formValue(data, 'budget_direction');
      // Confirm the submitted expectation is one of the choices on the form.
      if (!['Within typical range', 'Below typical range', 'Need budget guidance'].includes(budgetDirection)) {
        form.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('input[name="budget_direction"]')?.focus();
        return;
      }
      const projectTiming = formValue(data, 'project_timing');
      const leadStage =
        projectTiming === 'Just researching' ? 'Researching' :
        budgetDirection === 'Below typical range' ? 'Budget discussion needed' :
        projectTiming === 'As soon as possible' &&
          budgetDirection === 'Within typical range'
          ? 'Ready to proceed'
          : 'Considering project';
      if(errorNotice){errorNotice.hidden=true;errorNotice.textContent='';}
      const notes = formValue(data, 'notes');

      submit.disabled = true;
      submit.children[0]?.setAttribute('hidden', '');
      submit.children[1]?.removeAttribute('hidden');

      const queueNotes = [
        `Bathrooms: ${bathroomScope}`,
        'Typical complete renovation investment: LKR 1.5M–2.5M per bathroom',
        `Budget expectation: ${budgetDirection}`,
        `Expected start: ${projectTiming}`,
        `Enquiry stage: ${leadStage}`,
        sourceProject ? `Source project: ${sourceProject}` : '',
        'Initial consultation is free; no payment or appointment requested',
        'Optional design and quotation package: LKR 30,000 per bathroom, fully credited if BathSpace builds the corresponding bathroom',
        notes ? `Client requirements: ${notes}` : '',
      ].filter(Boolean).join('\n');

      // Only one authoritative record. Do not claim success or fire Lead events
      // until the database has confirmed that the application was accepted.
      const metaEventId = crypto.randomUUID();
      const attribution = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
      try {
        const { error } = await supabase.from('lx_site_inspections').insert({
          name,
          phone,
          email: null,
          location,
          space_slug: 'bathrooms',
          preferred_date: null,
          preferred_time: null,
          notes: queueNotes,
          bathroom_scope: bathroomScope,
          budget_expectation: budgetDirection,
          project_timing: projectTiming,
          lead_stage: leadStage,
          source_url: window.location.href,
          status: 'new',
          meta_event_id: metaEventId,
          fbclid: attribution.get('fbclid') || null,
          utm_source: attribution.get('utm_source') || null,
          utm_medium: attribution.get('utm_medium') || null,
          utm_campaign: attribution.get('utm_campaign') || null,
          utm_content: attribution.get('utm_content') || null,
          utm_term: attribution.get('utm_term') || null,
        });
        if(error) throw error;
      } catch (error) {
        console.error('[BathSpace] Consultation submission failed:', error);
        if(errorNotice){
          errorNotice.textContent='We could not save your application. Please check your connection and try again, or contact us through WhatsApp. No consultation is confirmed yet.';
          errorNotice.hidden=false;
          errorNotice.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});
        }
        submit.disabled=false;
        submit.children[1]?.setAttribute('hidden','');
        submit.children[0]?.removeAttribute('hidden');
        return;
      }

      /* luxeTrack loads fbevents.js before firing. Plain fbq would only queue
         the conversion when the deferred load has not run yet, and this is
         the last thing the visitor does before WhatsApp takes over. */
      const leadParams = {
        content_name: 'Bathroom Project Consultation Application',
        content_category: 'Bathroom enquiry',
      };
      const track = (window as any).luxeTrack;
      if (typeof track === 'function') {
        track('Lead', leadParams, { eventID: metaEventId });
      } else if (typeof (window as any).fbq === 'function') {
        (window as any).fbq('track', 'Lead', leadParams, { eventID: metaEventId });
      }
      fetch('/api/meta-capi', {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
        body: JSON.stringify({
          event_id: metaEventId,
          event_source_url: window.location.href,
          phone,
          name,
          service: 'Bathroom Project Consultation',
        }),
      }).catch(() => {});

      const message = [
        'Bathroom Enquiry — BATHSPACE BY LUXEHOME',
        '',
        `Name: ${name}`,
        `Phone: ${phone}`,
        `Location: ${location}`,
        `Bathrooms: ${bathroomScope}`,
        'Typical complete renovation: LKR 1.5M–2.5M per bathroom',
        `Budget expectation: ${budgetDirection}`,
        `Expected start: ${projectTiming}`,
        `Enquiry stage: ${leadStage}`,
        sourceProject ? `Source project: ${sourceProject}` : '',
        notes ? `Requirements: ${notes}` : '',
        'Initial consultation: free, no commitment',
      ].filter(Boolean).join('\n');
      const whatsappUrl = `https://wa.me/94774503744?text=${encodeURIComponent(message)}`;

      if (backupLink) backupLink.href = whatsappUrl;
      // Popups can be blocked after an asynchronous save; the visible
      // success link is the reliable way to continue to WhatsApp.

      form.hidden = true;
      success.hidden = false;
      if (successMessage) {
        successMessage.textContent = projectTiming === 'Just researching'
          ? 'Thanks for exploring BathSpace. We will contact you on WhatsApp to discuss design options, approximate budgets and next steps. You can share bathroom photos using the link below. No payment or site visit has been booked.'
          : 'Your enquiry is saved. We will contact you on WhatsApp to discuss your requirements and next steps. You can share photos using the link below. No payment or site visit has been booked.';
      }
      success.setAttribute("tabindex", "-1");
      success.focus();
      success.scrollIntoView({behavior: "smooth", block: "start"});
      if (typeof (window as any).gtag === 'function') {
        (window as any).gtag('event', 'consultation_application_submit', {
          event_category: 'Lead',
          event_label: 'Bathroom Project Consultation',
        });
      }
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .ibf-wrap {
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(43,50,42,.12);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(43,50,42,.08);
  }
  .ibf-error { background: #fff2ee; border: 1px solid #bd6047; color: #833c30; padding: .85rem 1rem; border-radius: 8px; line-height: 1.45; }
  .ibf-wrap form,
  .ibf-success { padding: clamp(1.35rem, 4vw, 2.4rem); }
  .ibf-heading { padding-bottom: 1.25rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--cream-deep); }
  .ibf-heading h2 { margin: .25rem 0 .4rem; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); }
  .ibf-heading > p:last-child { max-width: 58ch; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 67%, transparent); }
  .ibf-wrap form { display: grid; gap: 1rem; }
  .ibf-wrap form[hidden] { display: none; }
  .ibf-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: .85rem; }
  .ibf-wrap label > span,
  .ibf-wrap legend { display: block; margin-bottom: .42rem; font-size: .88rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); }
  .ibf-wrap label > span b,
  .ibf-wrap legend b { color: #9b493d; }
  .ibf-wrap label > span small { color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 48%, transparent); font-weight: 400; }
  .ibf-wrap input[type="text"],
  .ibf-wrap input[type="tel"],
  .ibf-wrap input[type="email"],
  .ibf-wrap input[type="date"],
  .ibf-wrap select,
  .ibf-wrap textarea {
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(43,50,42,.2);
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--ink);
    padding: .78rem .85rem;
    min-height: 48px;
    font: 400 1rem/1.4 var(--lx-sans);
  }
  .ibf-wrap textarea { resize: vertical; }
  .ibf-wrap input:focus,
  .ibf-wrap select:focus,
  .ibf-wrap textarea:focus { outline: 2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--gold) 55%, transparent); outline-offset: 1px; border-color: var(--gold); }
  .ibf-wrap fieldset { min-width: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; }
  .ibf-field-note { margin: -.12rem 0 .55rem; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 66%, transparent); font-size: .85rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .ibf-budget-question { margin: .9rem 0 .55rem; font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); }
  .ibf-budget-question b { color: #9b493d; }
  .ibf-context-note { margin: .6rem 0 .2rem; padding: .85rem 1rem; border-left: 2px solid var(--sage-deep); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--cream) 65%, white); color: var(--ink); font-size: .86rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .ibf-context-note[hidden] { display: none; }
  .ibf-choice-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: .55rem; }
  .ibf-choice-grid--two { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  .ibf-choice-grid--four { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  .ibf-choice-grid label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: .55rem;
    min-height: 100%;
    padding: .72rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(43,50,42,.16);
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--cream) 70%, #fff);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .ibf-choice-grid input { flex: 0 0 auto; margin-top: .12rem; accent-color: var(--sage-deep); }
  .ibf-choice-grid label > span { margin: 0; font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.45; }
  .ibf-help { display: block; margin-top: .35rem; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 70%, transparent); font-size: .82rem; }
  .ibf-fee {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: .8fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.05rem;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: var(--sage-deep);
    color: var(--cream);
  }
  .ibf-fee > div span,
  .ibf-fee > div strong { display: block; }
  .ibf-fee > div span { color: var(--gold-soft); font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .ibf-fee > div strong { margin-top: .25rem; font: 600 1.7rem var(--lx-serif); }
  .ibf-fee ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.1rem; color: rgba(247,243,235,.9); font-size: .86rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .ibf-consent { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: .65rem; cursor: pointer; }
  .ibf-consent input { flex: 0 0 auto; margin-top: .18rem; accent-color: var(--sage-deep); }
  .ibf-consent > span { margin: 0 !important; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 82%, transparent) !important; font-size: .86rem !important; font-weight: 400 !important; line-height: 1.5; }
  .ibf-submit {
    width: 100%;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--gold);
    color: #fff;
    min-height: 50px;
    padding: .9rem 1.2rem;
    font: 600 .95rem var(--lx-sans);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .ibf-submit:disabled { cursor: wait; opacity: .72; }
  .ibf-footnote { text-align: center; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 70%, transparent); font-size: .82rem; }
  .ibf-privacy { margin-top: -.35rem; text-align: center; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 58%, transparent); font-size: .76rem; }
  .ibf-privacy a { color: var(--sage-deep); text-underline-offset: 2px; }
  .ibf-honeypot { position: absolute !important; left: -9999px !important; width: 1px !important; height: 1px !important; opacity: 0 !important; }
  .ibf-success { min-height: 420px; display: grid; place-content: center; justify-items: center; text-align: center; }
  .ibf-success[hidden] { display: none; }
  .ibf-success > span { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--sage-deep); color: #fff; font-size: 1.3rem; }
  .ibf-success h2 { margin: .8rem 0 .4rem; font-size: 2.3rem; }
  .ibf-success p { max-width: 52ch; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 68%, transparent); }
  .ibf-success a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 48px; margin-top: 1rem; border-radius: 999px; padding: .75rem 1rem; background: var(--gold); color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 600; }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .ibf-grid,
    .ibf-choice-grid,
    .ibf-choice-grid--two,
    .ibf-choice-grid--four,
    .ibf-fee { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .ibf-fee { gap: .6rem; }
  }
</style>
